  "promotion_rule": "FRESH_TRIGGER + INTENT_BINDING + SOURCE_PROVENANCE + NONZERO_STATE_DELTA + DEMIHEAD_PASS = VERIFIED_RETURN_CANDIDATE; predictive learning still requires an independently observed resolved outcome",
